<% provide(:title, "Airline Baggage Allowance Exchange") %>
<% provide(:meta_description, "White-label B2B Bid/Ask exchange allowing passengers on the same flight to trade digital baggage weight allowance between T-48h and T-4h before departure.") %>

<section class="smb-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center gy-4">
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="smb-b2b-pill mb-3">
          <i class="fas fa-plane-departure" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span>B2B White-Label Ancillary Engine for Airlines</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="display-5 mb-3">
          Turn unused passenger baggage allowance into <span class="text-primary">high-margin ancillary revenue</span>.
        </h1>

        <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">
          Between <strong>T-48h and T-4h</strong> before departure, passengers on the same flight trade <strong>digital PNR weight allowance</strong> on a live Bid/Ask order book. No physical parcels change hands — zero airport security or customs risk, strict aircraft payload compliance, and instant 25% ancillary margin for the airline.
        </p>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
          <%= link_to flights_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4" do %>
            <i class="fas fa-chart-line me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Explore Live Flight Order Books
          <% end %>
          <%= link_to airline_roi_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4" do %>
            <i class="fas fa-calculator me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Airline ROI &amp; Fleet Simulator
          <% end %>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-3 pt-2">
          <div class="col-6 col-sm-3">
            <div class="fw-bold fs-4 text-dark"><%= @stats[:live_flights] %></div>
            <div class="small text-muted">Active flight markets</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-sm-3">
            <div class="fw-bold fs-4 text-dark"><%= format_kg(@stats[:matched_kg]) %></div>
            <div class="small text-muted">PNR weight matched</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-sm-3">
            <div class="fw-bold fs-4 text-success"><%= format_euros(@stats[:retained_cash_cents]) %></div>
            <div class="small text-muted">Airline cash retained</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 col-sm-3">
            <div class="fw-bold fs-4 text-primary"><%= format_euros(@stats[:passenger_savings_cents]) %></div>
            <div class="small text-muted">Saved vs airport desk</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <div class="smb-card p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
            <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Why Airlines Deploy ShareMyBag</span>
            <span class="smb-badge smb-badge--emerald">100% Digital PNR</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="list-unstyled d-grid gap-3 mb-4">
            <li class="d-flex gap-3">
              <div class="smb-step-number flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fw-bold text-dark">Zero airport security or customs blockers</div>
                <div class="small text-muted">Passengers pack and check only their own suitcase. Only digital kg entitlements move between two PNRs on the same flight.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-3">
              <div class="smb-step-number flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fw-bold text-dark">Zero aircraft payload creep</div>
                <div class="small text-muted">Every trade transfers weight 1:1 inside the aircraft's certified baggage envelope and closes automatically at T-4h Weight &amp; Balance cutoff.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="d-flex gap-3">
              <div class="smb-step-number flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
              <div>
                <div class="fw-bold text-dark">25% margin + 100% voucher treasury retention</div>
                <div class="small text-muted">Sellers receive airline flight credits for future bookings, keeping up to 100% of trade liquidity inside the carrier's ecosystem.</div>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="p-3 rounded bg-light border small text-muted">
            <strong class="text-dark">Try a live match in 10 seconds:</strong> sign in with our pre-booked demo passenger accounts on <%= link_to "Sign in", signin_path %> and execute a Bid/Ask order on flight AF718.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-end justify-content-between gap-3 mb-4">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h3 mb-1">Live Commercial Flight Exchanges</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Real-time Bid/Ask order books anchored to each aircraft's certified baggage payload.</p>
      </div>
      <%= link_to flights_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" do %>
        View all flights <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ms-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <% end %>
    </div>

    <% if @featured_flights.any? %>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <% @featured_flights.each do |flight| %>
          <% econ = AirlineEconomicsService.flight_summary(flight) %>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <article class="smb-card smb-card--interactive p-4 h-100 d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="smb-airline-code" aria-hidden="true"><%= flight.airline_code %></span>
                  <div>
                    <div class="fw-bold text-dark"><%= flight.flight_number %> · <%= flight.airline_name %></div>
                    <div class="small text-muted"><%= flight.aircraft_type.aircraft_name %> (<%= flight.aircraft_type.seat_capacity %> seats)</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="<%= status_badge_class(flight.trading_open? ? 'open' : 'closed') %>">
                  <%= flight.trading_open? ? "Open" : "Cutoff" %>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="smb-flight-route-badge mb-1">
                <span><%= flight.departure_iata %></span>
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-primary small" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span><%= flight.arrival_iata %></span>
              </div>
              <div class="small text-muted mb-3">
                <%= flight.departure_city %> to <%= flight.arrival_city %> · Departs <%= l(flight.departure_at, format: :short) %> UTC
              </div>

              <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                <div class="col-6">
                  <div class="p-2 rounded bg-light border">
                    <div class="small text-muted">Spot price</div>
                    <div class="fw-bold text-primary"><%= format_euros(flight.spot_price_cents) %>/kg</div>
                    <div class="small text-success">vs <%= format_euros(flight.airport_excess_fee_per_kg_cents) %> desk</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-6">
                  <div class="p-2 rounded bg-light border">
                    <div class="small text-muted">Active demand</div>
                    <div class="fw-bold text-dark"><%= format_kg(flight.total_demand_kg) %></div>
                    <div class="small text-muted">Supply: <%= format_kg(flight.total_supply_kg) %></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mb-3">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small mb-1">
                  <span class="text-muted">Aircraft baggage load</span>
                  <span class="fw-semibold text-dark"><%= flight.payload_utilization_percent %>% of <%= format_kg(flight.max_baggage_payload_kg) %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="smb-payload-meter" role="progressbar"
                     aria-label="Aircraft baggage payload utilization for <%= flight.flight_number %>"
                     aria-valuenow="<%= flight.payload_utilization_percent.round %>"
                     aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100">
                  <div class="smb-payload-bar <%= percent_width_class(flight.payload_utilization_percent) %>"></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-auto pt-3 border-top d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                <div class="small text-muted">
                  Airline margin: <strong class="text-success"><%= format_euros(econ[:airline_net_margin_cents]) %></strong>
                </div>
                <%= link_to flight_path(flight), class: "btn btn-sm btn-primary" do %>
                  Open order book
                <% end %>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% else %>
      <div class="smb-empty-state">
        <p class="mb-0 text-muted">No live flights scheduled yet.</p>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-white border-top">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <h2 class="h3 mb-3">Solving the exact airline pain point — nothing more, nothing less.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
          On every commercial departure, aircraft fuel and payload envelopes are planned around booked baggage weight. Rigid 23 kg allowances leave ~40% of passengers flying light while 15% pay punitive €15/kg airport counter fees or abandon luggage at check-in.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="smb-kpi-card smb-kpi-card--emerald">
              <div class="smb-kpi-label">Light Passenger (ASK)</div>
              <div class="smb-kpi-value">+€50–€80</div>
              <div class="smb-kpi-sub">Monetizes unused kg into instant airline flight vouchers.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="smb-kpi-card smb-kpi-card--brand">
              <div class="smb-kpi-label">Heavy Passenger (BID)</div>
              <div class="smb-kpi-value">-45% to -55%</div>
              <div class="smb-kpi-sub">Buys exact needed kg pre-flight instead of airport desk penalties.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="smb-kpi-card smb-kpi-card--amber">
              <div class="smb-kpi-label">Airline Operator</div>
              <div class="smb-kpi-value">25% + Voucher</div>
              <div class="smb-kpi-sub">Captures pure ancillary margin while cutting check-in queues.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>